    modified_response: "I will create `src/components/InterviewSimulator.tsx`, an interactive AI interview platform that generates custom behavioural, technical, and situational prep questions based on the candidate\'s target job title, lets the user type draft responses, and evaluates them with real-time feedback (scores, positive callouts, red flags, and an expertly written model response to copy)."
