lidation to verify it enforces the necessary structure and data types.\n\n\n**Validating Nested Question Fields**\n\nI\'m now focusing on validating the nested properties within the `questions` array schema for the `/api/interview-simulator` route. I\'m verifying the types and descriptions for `id`, `questionText`, `category`, `intent`, and `tips` to ensure that the strict schema I defined is accurately enforced. I\'m also now testing various error cases.\n\n\n**Validating Response Structure**\n\nI\'m now implementing error handling for the `/api/interview-evaluate` route. I\'ve designed the JSON response to include `rating`, `score`, `positives`, `improvements`, and `alternativeAnswer` fields. I\'m carefully structuring the fallback within the catch block, ensuring data integrity. I am also now focused on testing the validity of the response.\n\n\n**Refining Schema Verification**\n\nI\'m now implementing the validation of the response data structure, specifically focusing on `/api/interview-evaluate`. The JSON response, including fields such as `rating`, `score`, `positives`, `improvements`, and `alternativeAnswer`, is being meticulously verified against the defined schema. I am testing the robustness of this check.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rating\": \"Bom\",\n  \"score\": 8,\n  \"positives\": [\n    \"Respondeu de forma clara e concisa\",\n    \"Demonstrou conhecimento sobre o assunto\"\n  ],\n  \"improvements\": [\n    \"Poderia dar mais exemplos pr\303\241ticos\",\n    \"Mostrar mais entusiasmo\"\n  ],\n  \"alternativeAnswer\": \"Demonstrar entusiasmo e dar exemplos pr\303\241ticos para demonstrar conhecimento.\"\n}\n```\n\n\n**Defining Company Dossier**\n\nI\'m now implementing error handling for the `/api/company-dossier` route. I\'ve designed a JSON schema to ensure data integrity and compliance, including \"companyName,\" \"industry,\" \"description,\" \"headquarters,\" and \"employees,\" each with string data types. The goal is to standardize the fallback. I am f